[[File:Central Square Station Detective Pikachu.png|thumb|250px|A depiction of central square station from [[Detective Pikachu Ryme City Guide]]]]
The '''central square''' (Japanese: '''{{tt|中央広場|ちゅうおうひろば}}''' ''central square'') of [[Ryme City]] is a location in the game {{OBP|Detective Pikachu|video game}}. It is known for being the central point of the city's annual [[Pokémon Carnival]], with each of the three parade routes meeting here. Prominent buildings in the area include the central square subway station, as well as the surrounding residential area which features older, historic buildings<ref>Detective Pikachu Ryme City Guide</ref>. Most of Chapter 9 takes place here.

